   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I am glad you asked!\r\n\r\nProfessions are skills pertaining to crafting, gathering, and general survival. There are many to choose from, with each offering their own unique benefits and economic opportunities. Whether you seek wealth, an opportunity to stock your guild's warehouse with useful items, or simply enjoy the satisfaction of wearing equipment crafted by your own hand, there's a profession for that.\r\n\r\nCrafting recipes can be learned from trainers, such as those around here, and numerous other sources across Azeroth. Once learned, you can craft as many of that item as you wish, provided you can acquire the necessary materials.",
   "time": 1791810674,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
